{
  "comment": [
    "Channel id scheme 2 (ARCHITECTURE.md decision 6), run by BOTH readers:",
    "tests/test_channel_ids.py drives bin/omarchy-iptv, tests/Model.test.js",
    "drives Model.js, and neither reimplements the rule. Every id here is a",
    "literal, computed from the pinned fnv1a32 vectors, so a change to either",
    "implementation has to disagree with the file rather than with itself.",
    "",
    "`rotate` is the defect: the provider changes the account password, which",
    "lives inside every stream URL. Both readers apply it to every url and",
    "recount how many ids survived. Hosts are .test and the credentials are",
    "obviously fake; no real URL is ever committed."
  ],
  "rotate": { "from": "/p4ssw0rd/", "to": "/n3wp4ss/" },
  "foldComment": [
    "Folding is two jobs. `search` is normalize_text / Model.normalizeText,",
    "which every query and every searchKey goes through and which must keep",
    "dropping punctuation: a user typing `amc` has to reach `USA: AMC+`.",
    "`id` is normalize_id_text / Model.normalizeIdText, which keeps + and *",
    "because those are the characters that tell two live streams apart.",
    "Both readers run this table, so neither implementation can change one",
    "job while believing it changed the other. Accented spellings are",
    "written as \\u escapes: CLAUDE.md rule 8, ASCII only in .py and .js,",
    "and this file is read by both."
  ],
  "folds": [
    { "name": "USA  AMC", "id": "usa amc", "search": "usa amc" },
    { "name": "USA: AMC+", "id": "usa amc+", "search": "usa amc" },
    { "name": "USA: AMC +", "id": "usa amc +", "search": "usa amc" },
    { "name": "US: ESPN", "id": "us espn", "search": "us espn" },
    { "name": "US: ESPN*", "id": "us espn*", "search": "us espn" },
    { "name": "US NESN (A)", "id": "us nesn a", "search": "us nesn a" },
    { "name": "US NESN+ (A)", "id": "us nesn+ a", "search": "us nesn a" },
    { "name": "T\u00e9l\u00e9 Qu\u00e9bec", "id": "tele quebec", "search": "tele quebec" },
    { "name": "Tele-Quebec", "id": "tele quebec", "search": "tele quebec" },
    { "name": "  US: Sky Sports  Main Event  ", "id": "us sky sports main event", "search": "us sky sports main event" },
    { "name": "+++", "id": "+++", "search": "" },
    { "name": "***", "id": "***", "search": "" },
    { "name": "Channel 11", "id": "channel 11", "search": "channel 11" },
    { "name": "!@#$%^&()", "id": "", "search": "" }
  ],
